nd{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\\}" "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\,:\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\\}"] [:db/cas 17592186430963 :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\\}" "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\,:\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\\}"] [:db/cas 17592186430964 :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{1}\\in R\\}" "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}\\,:\\,{x}_{1}\\in R\\}"] [:db/cas 17592186430965 :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{1}\\in R\\}" "\\{\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}\\,:\\,{x}_{1}\\in R\\}"] [:db/cas 17592186430969 :question/problem "Consider the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -7\\end{aligned}]$ and the vector $b=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ k\\end{aligned}].$ Find the value of $k$ such that $b\\in \\text{Null}(A).$" "Consider the matrix $A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -7\\end{bmatrix}$ and the vector $b=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ k\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find the value of $k$ such that $b\\in \\text{Null}(A).$"] [:db/cas 17592186430969 :question/worked-solution "If $b\\in \\text{Null}(A),$ then we must have $Ab=0.$ Substituting the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ab & =0 \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}2 & -7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ k\\end{aligned}] & =0 \\\\ -7k & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand for this equation, we obtain $k=0.$" "If $b\\in \\text{Null}(A),$ then we must have $Ab=0.$ Substituting the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ab & =0 \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ k\\end{bmatrix} & =0 \\\\ -7k & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand for this equation, we obtain $k=0.$"] [:db/cas 17592186431005 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186431006 :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" "\\begin{